I write the role-race-alignment and starting date of the game to the
beginning of my note file. Of course this doesn't eliminate the
confusion of possible forgotten notes from an earlier game, but at least
it makes old notes easier to detect.
I always use the same file name for the notes, and when I start a new
game, I copy my notes template file to that name, so I don't have
several potential note files to choose from, I always know which one is
current (or at least most current).

